  "title": "Toyota Mobility Foundation Names Winning Innovators across Varanasi, Venice, and Detroit in Global Sustainable Cities Challenge",
  "summary": "Toyota Mobility Foundation (TMF) announces the full list of winners of its global Sustainable Cities Challenge (SCC), the organization's largest initiative to date. The news follows last week's conclusion of the Challenge's final of three sections, held in Varanasi, India, after the winners in the other two host cities―Detroit, Michigan, and Venice, Italy―were named earlier this year, as they shared their winning innovators and mobility solutions.",
